# Dart/Flutter 生成目录
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub/
**/coverage/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# 本地测试、诊断和性能产物
**/test-results/
**/reports/
**/screenshots/
**/*.log
**/*.pid
**/tmp/
**/.tmp/
**/.internal_docs/

# 平台构建缓存和临时目录
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
ios/Pods/
macos/Pods/
linux/flutter/ephemeral/
windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# 本地 IDE 和操作系统文件
.idea/
*.iml
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# 本地环境、签名和密钥
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties

# 运行时用户数据，不包含测试 fixture
